                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Running platform script enhancements or database updates directly on a live corporate website can trigger code errors that break your checkout funnels or forms. We prevent this by building a mirroring, offline sandbox environment to safely configuration-test all technical patches first. Once we confirm the update functions flawlessly, we merge the validated code into your live platform seamlessly.</p>
